		"sections": [
			{
				"id": 29746,
				"title": "Overview",
				"body_text": "Orta rattles against the shackles of his infection, shattering the ground with [Colossal Slam] and invoking [Rupturing Runes].\r\n\r\nAt 100 energy, Orta will cast [Tectonic Roar], knocking all players away with his bellow.",
				"sections": [
					{
						"id": 29747,
						"title": "Tanks",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Rupturing Runes] stun players when triggered.\r\n\r\n$bullet;[Tectonic Roar] knocks players back a significant distance.\r\n\r\n$bullet;Players caught in [Mountain's Grasp] will be thrown by [Discard Weaklings]."
					},
					{
						"id": 29749,
						"title": "Healers",
